00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.910
They have their whole love story on tape.

505
00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:54.190
Like this documentary crew has been documenting this love story.

506
00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:58.390
Like I remember you saying, Jenna, could you imagine if you could go back to that first

